  "id": "creamy-potato-salad",
  "name": "Creamy Potato Salad",
  "subtitle": "Tender potatoes tossed with a tangy mayonnaise dressing and chopped eggs.",
  "description": "A classic American potato salad with crisp celery, onion, mustard, and paprika.",
